    Requirement('SR-050', 'FR-REG-03', 'H', 'C', '§5', 'Approve shall write the corrected time(s) into the day’s session/attendance record and trigger FR-JOB-01 to recompute that day’s status. v1.0 approval only flipped a status flag and never touched attendance data (Appendix A-05). Reject leaves attendance untouched. Cancel: Pending only, by owner or admin.'),
