    Requirement('SR-053', 'FR-LEA-02', 'M', 'C', '§5', 'Create {leave_type, start_date, end_date, session (Full/First- half/Second-half), reason}: dates parsed and swapped if reversed; days requested = working days in range per the employee’s weekly-off pattern, minus organisation holidays in range (the same function used at approval and reporting — see FR-LEA-09); balance check is remaining >= requested inside the same transaction as the insert (CC-06); overlap check against Pending/Approved leaves is a database exclusion constraint (CC-05), not just an app query; on success, leave_balance.reserved += requested and the row is inserted Pending.'),
