    Requirement('SR-073', 'FR-EXP-03', 'M', 'C', '§5', 'Status transitions are a strict state machine: Pending → Approved/Rejected by manager or HR (self-approval blocked: actor ≠ claim owner); Approved → Paid by Finance only (not “any logged-in user” as in v1.0 — Appendix A-11); each transition is a conditional update and audited.'),
