    Requirement('SR-081', 'FR-ONB-01', 'M', 'C', '§5', 'Five steps: Offer Acceptance & Pre-boarding → Document Collection & Verification → System & Access Provisioning → Workstation & ID Card → Orientation & Buddy Assignment. A pre-hire record can view/upload documents via a scoped pre-boarding token link without a normal login, because allow_login = false until step 3. v1.0 required the same pre-hire user to log in to upload documents while login was disabled — a contradiction (Appendix A-14).'),
