    Requirement('SR-084', 'FR-ONB-04', 'M', 'C', '§5', 'Document upload/review as v1.0 (size gates, Approve/Reject with mandatory notes on reject), through the FR-DOC-02 validation pipeline.'),
    Requirement('SR-085', 'FR-ONB-05', 'M', 'C', '§5', 'Step advancement is guard-based, automatic once its guard is satisfied, and HR is only asked to confirm physical/logistics steps (workstation ready, ID card issued) — the system does not ask the new hire to “complete their own introduction” as the terminal action (v1.0’s step 5 — Appendix A-15). Step 5 (orientation) is marked complete by the assigned buddy or manager.'),
