    Requirement('SR-089', 'FR-OFF-03', 'M', 'C', '§5', 'Stage completion is a conditional update per stage with its own guard (assets returned = 0 outstanding; settlement approved by Finance); access revocation (allow_login = false, sessions killed, permissions cleared) executes automatically at 00:00 IST on the last working day, not only when someone manually finishes stage 5 (Appendix A-17). users.status → Inactive.'),
